Cell["\<\
You know several ways to build an Augmented Matrix (AM) out of vectors and \
smaller matrices.  \
\>", "Subitem",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9689252050506372`*^9, 3.9689253372326636`*^9}, {
  3.96892536849667*^9, 3.9689253689294295`*^9}, {3.9689266491685333`*^9, 
